/**
\mainpage
\b resource_retriever is a package used for loading files from a url into memory.  It also provides special handling of the package:// prefix, allowing things to be referenced
by path relative to the share directory of a package.


\section codeapi Code API

 - resource_retriever::Retriever -- Use this class to retrieve files, with its get_shared() method.
 - resource_retriever::Resource -- A retrieved file, loaded into memory.
 - resource_retriever::Exception -- Thrown when a file cannot be retrieved.
 - resource_retriever::plugins::RetrieverPlugin -- Interface to implement to support other types of urls.


*/